        "11683A: RANGE 100 mW, POLARITY NORMAL, FUNCTION STANDBY, REF SWITCH EXT, LINE OFF. Wait for the drift to stop.",
        "DC calibrator: 0 V, DC, output OFF. Meter filter 512; Zero; the display should read 0 ±0.05 µW.",
        "DC calibrator 144.93 mV, output '+'; 11683A FUNCTION CALIBRATE; press Cal.",
        "Set the DC calibrator to each row's voltage and the meter filter to the row's value."
